{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Vanessa: Dinner for Four"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Flour on the Floor"}, {"type": "position", "content": 11}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 3}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.1"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": " Identify and describe personal and regional eating habits and cooking in a range of communicative situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": " Writes short texts about presenting plans for a future activity using correct spelling, grammar, cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to the communicative functions for this level."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": " Writes short texts about presenting plans for a future activity using correct spelling, grammar, cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to the communicative functions for this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": " Writes short texts about presenting plans for a future activity using correct spelling, grammar, cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to the communicative functions for this level."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": " Writes short texts about presenting plans for a future activity using correct spelling, grammar, cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to the communicative functions for this level."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn6le03ob11re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Expressing Necessity"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "\u201cHave got to\u201d is used to express necessity.<br /> \u201cGoing to have to\u201d expresses a necessary action in the future or a condition."}, {"type": "text", "content": "\u201cHave got to\u201d has irregular forms in the past and future. Look at the chart below."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":5,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Present</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">Subject <br/>I/You/We/They</div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">+ <span class=\\\"strong\\\">have got</span> to<br/><span class=\\\"strong\\\">'ve got</span> to</div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"+  verb in base form (infinitive)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"+  complement\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Present</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">Subject <br/>He/She</div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">+ <span class=\\\"strong\\\">has got</span> to<br/><span class=\\\"strong\\\">'s got</span> to</div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"+  verb in base form (infinitive)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"+  complement\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Past</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">Subject</div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">+ <span class=\\\"strong\\\">had</span> to</div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"+  verb in base form (infinitive)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"+  complement\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Future</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">Subject</div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">+ will + <span class=\\\"strong\\\">have</span> + to</div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"+  verb in base form (infinitive)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"+  complement\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Examples:"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Present\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Past\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Future\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> I've got to save money.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> I had to live on a tight budget.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> I will have to watch my spending habits.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use \"<span class=\"strong\">Don't have to</span>\" or \"<span class=\"strong\">Doesn't have to</span>\" to express what is not necessary. <br/>Remember to use a verb in its base form after \"<span class=\"strong\">Don't</span>/<span class=\"strong\">Doesn't have to</span>\".<br/> <br/>Structure:"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":1,\"columns\":5,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">Subject <br/>You/We/I/They <br/>She/He </div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">+ auxiliary in negative<br/><span class=\\\"strong\\\">don't <br/>doesn't</span></div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"+  <span class=\\\"italic\\\">have</span> to\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"+ verb in base form (infinitive)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"+ complement\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Examples: <br/>You <span class=\"strong\">don't</span> <span class=\"italic\">have</span> to eat just a little bit or eat only salads. <br/> She <span class=\"strong\">doesn't</span> <span class=\"italic\">have</span> to watch her portions."}, {"type": "text", "content": "\u201cGoing to have to\u201d also expresses a necessary action in the future."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Examples:<br/><span class=\"italic\">I'm gonna have to cut down on my coffee. </span><br/>  <span class=\"italic\">I'm going to have to invest in a small machine.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "It's also used as a conditional for a resulting action."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Example: <br/><span class=\"italic\">Because I'm on a tight budget, I'm going to have to cook more often at home. </span>"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " How much did you use to have?"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " \u201c<span class=\"strong\">Used to</span>\u201d and \u201c<span class=\"strong\">would</span>\u201d express an action that occurred regularly in the past."}, {"type": "text", "content": "But: <br/>Only \"<span class=\"strong\">used to</span>\" expresses repeated habits in the past. <br/>Only \"<span class=\"strong\">would</span>\" is more formal and sentimental."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Structure:"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Used to\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Would\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Subject + <span class=\\\"strong\\\">used to</span> + verb in basic form (infinitive) + complement\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Subject + <span class=\\\"strong\\\">would</span> + verb in basic form (infinitive) + complement\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Examples:"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Past Pattern with <span class=\\\"italic\\\">used</span> to\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Past Pattern with <span class=\\\"italic\\\">would</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Present\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" I used to drink 6 cups of coffee a day.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" I would spend a lot of money at the cafe.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Now I have only 3 cups of coffee a day.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" My family used to cook a lot at birthday parties\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" I would end up ingesting a lot of oily food.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" I enjoy the food, but I don't have too much of it.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to saute"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to pan fry food with a small amount of oil "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I have to saute vegetables with my dinner."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le03ob11aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use to talk about cooking and diet."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to cut down"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to reduce on the amount you use or consume"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I've gotta cut down on the sweets and the fries."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le03ob11aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to go through"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to use a certain amount of something in a period of time"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We go through a quart of skim milk a week at home."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le03ob11aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to ingest"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " to eat or swallow"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: At birthday parties and festivals, I would ingest a lot of deep fried foods."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le03ob11aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to burn (energy or calories)"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to expend, to use up or spend"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You're going to have to burn those calories because you ate so much. (See below)"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le03ob11aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "calorie"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a unit used to measure the amount of energy that foods will produce in the body"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I need to eat more low calorie foods to not gain weight."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le03ob11aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "You are going to plan the celebration meal for your next birthday."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write down the dish you would like your family to make for you and the ingredients necessary for that dish. Write the whole menu plan in English."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Include healthy but tasty food in your menu."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Show the menu plan to your family. Keep it until your birthday."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I describe how food is prepared. I express quantity."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write names of food in English."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I include nutritious foods in my menu plan."}]}], "labs": [{"exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "stimuli_ids": [0], "type": "WLC", "questions": [], "img_path": "", "id": 0, "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can talk about daily routines and eating habits."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can express what is necessary. "}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can talk about people's past habits."}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " Do you eat anything unhealthy? "}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " What do you think is a healthy meal?"}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "What healthy habits  would you recommend people acquire?"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Welcome"}], "type": "group"}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correc