": "engenn6le03ob11re2img05.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: Well, I've got to. And I've reduced my caffeine intake to 3 cups of coffee a day. I used to have 6 cups a day. I go through a quart of skim milk a week at home when I didn't use to have any. I also consume a pint of real fruit juice throughout the afternoon.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Peter</span>: It's so hard to be healthy eating with my family. At birthday parties and festivals, I would ingest  a lot of deep fried foods, and oily dishes."}, {"time": "47000", "image": "engenn6le03ob11re2img05.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Well, enjoy the food, but don't have too much of it.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: You're going to have to burn those calories. I've gotta cut down on the sweets and the fries, too.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Peter</span>: Yes, and you also have got to focus on the results and just stick with your strategy."}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}]}]}